      "title": "Follow one tRNA through the ribosome",
      "narration": "Follow one tRNA all the way through. It enters at the A site. Its anticodon matches, so it stays. A peptide bond forms at the P site. Then our tRNA moves to the P site. Another tRNA comes in, and the chain is handed over. Now our tRNA moves to the E site, empty. Then it leaves. A, then P, then E, like stops on a train line. Now try the question again.",
